<title>ESTONIA: TALIBOR AND TALIBID INTERBANK RATES STABLE.</title>
<headline>TALIBOR AND TALIBID INTERBANK RATES STABLE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average interbank rates were</p>
<p>unchanged from the last week, the central bank said on Wenesday.</p>
<p>The central bank every Wednesday releases average weighted</p>
<p>interest rates for interbank loans.</p>
<p>&quot;Most banks are seeking borrowing for investment projects on</p>
<p>the overnight market with the expectation that they will have</p>
<p>funds coming on line soon, so there is almost no action in the</p>
<p>other rates,&quot; one money market analyst said.</p>
<p>  TALIBOR/TALIBID   1Week	 1Month    3Month</p>
<p>  May 7		4.50/3.50  5.93/4.93  7.48/6.48</p>
<p>  April 30	   4.50/3.50  5.93/4.93  7.48/6.48</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
